mic contrast between breathy, intimate verses and powerful, chest-voice belting in the chorus. Harmony: Unison octave doubling in the final chorus for emotional weight.\n\nArrangement: \nPrimary instruments: Acoustic grand piano, emotional pop string section (violins and cellos). Secondary instruments: Nylon string acoustic guitar, standard pop drum kit.\nSection-level instrument evolution: Intro features a lonely, melodic piano motif. Verse 1 is strictly vocal and intimate piano. Verse 2 adds fingerpicked acoustic guitar and light shaker. Pre-chorus builds with orchestral tom drums. Chorus explodes with full sweeping pop strings and powerful crash cymbals. String Interlude features a soaring violin melody. Final Chorus is maximum emotional intensity with full orchestration. Outro strips everything away, returning to the lonely piano motif from the intro, ending on an unresolved, lingering chord.\nGroove: Slow, expressive, rubato feel in the intro, strict tempo in the chorus. Spatial effects: Massive concert hall reverb on the chorus strings and vocals, dry and close-mic vocal in the verses.", "[Intro]\n(Soft, melancholic acoustic piano melody)\n\n[Verse]\n窗外的雨 滴答滴 落在玻璃\n翻阅着 旧照片 里的 记忆\n那时候 的我们 笑得很 彻底\n以为能 走到 时间的 尽头里\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n后来 风吹过 几个秋季\n有些人 走着走散 在 人海里\n如果 遗憾是 成长的 必修课\n我宁愿 永远 不要 毕业 呢\n\n[Chorus]\n我还在 原地 等一个 奇迹\n哪怕 岁月 已经 斑驳了 痕迹\n那些 没说出口的 对不起\n化作 深夜里 最痛的 呼吸\n原来 失去你 是场 漫长的 雨\n\n[String Interlude]\n(Sweeping emotional pop strings)\n\n[Chorus]\n我还在 原地 等一个 奇迹\n哪怕 岁月 已经 斑驳了 痕迹\n那些 没说出口的 对不起\n化作 深夜里 最痛的 呼吸\n\n[Outro]\n(Fading piano single notes, lingering emotion)\n原来 失去你... 是场 漫长的 雨...", 222, "fixed", 180.00000000000003, 1.7, 50], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "caption"}, "name": "caption", "label": "caption", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "caption"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widg